.TH DIFFA-EXPORT 1 "November 2025" "diffa 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
diffa\-export \- export patch in various formats
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B diffa export
\fIPATCH\fR [\fB\-f\fR \fIFORMAT\fR] [\fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Exports a patch file to human-readable or machine-readable formats for reporting, documentation, or integration with other tools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-format \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format (default: text):
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
.B text
- Human-readable plain text summary
.IP \(bu 2
.B json
- Machine-readable JSON structure
.IP \(bu 2
.B html
- Styled HTML report (browser-friendly)
.IP \(bu 2
.B diff
- Unix diff-style format
.RE
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output \fIPATH\fR
Write output to file (default: stdout)
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Export as text to stdout:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffa export update.patch
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export as HTML report:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffa export changes.patch \-f html \-o report.html
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export as JSON for processing:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffa export data.patch \-f json | jq '.operations | length'
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export as unified diff:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffa export update.patch \-f diff \-o changes.diff
.fi
.RE
.SH OUTPUT FORMATS
.SS TEXT
Human-readable summary with operation counts and file listings.
.SS JSON
Structured data with operations array, metadata, and statistics. Schema:
.PP
.RS
.nf
{
  "metadata": {
    "created": "ISO8601 timestamp",
    "operationCount": integer,
    "reversible": boolean
  },
  "operations": [
    {
      "type": "add|remove|modify|move",
      "path": "string",
      "from": "string (move only)",
      "size": integer
    }
  ],
  "statistics": {
    "added": integer,
    "removed": integer,
    "modified": integer,
    "moved": integer
  }
}
.fi
.RE
.SS HTML
Styled HTML document with:
.IP \(bu 2
Color-coded operations (green=add, red=remove, yellow=modify)
.IP \(bu 2
Sortable tables
.IP \(bu 2
Summary statistics
.IP \(bu 2
Responsive design
.SS DIFF
Unix diff-style format compatible with standard diff tools.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (invalid format)
.TP
.B 3
File system error (patch file not found)
.SH USE CASES
.IP \(bu 2
Documentation: Generate HTML reports for deployment documentation
.IP \(bu 2
Automation: Parse JSON output in CI/CD pipelines
.IP \(bu 2
Code review: Generate diff-style output for review tools
.IP \(bu 2
Analysis: Export to JSON for statistical analysis
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR diffa (1),
.BR diffa\-patch (1),
.BR diffa\-compare (1)
